                <!-- before you start start -->
                <div class="mm-sg-before p-relative z-index-2" id="how-start">
                    <div class="container container-1430">
                        <div class="row justify-content-center">
                            <div class="col-xl-9">
                                <div class="mm-sg-head text-center">
                                    <span class="mm-section-kicker">BEFORE YOU START</span>
                                    <h2 class="mm-sg-title">Three things<br><em>and you are ready.</em></h2>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="row">
                            <div class="col-lg-4 col-md-6 mb-25 tp_fade_anim" data-delay=".3">
                                <div class="mm-sg-req">
                                    <span class="mm-sg-req__num">01</span>
                                    <h3>Your signature is built</h3>
                                    <p>Finish it in the builder before you start here.</p>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                            <div class="col-lg-4 col-md-6 mb-25 tp_fade_anim" data-delay=".5">
                                <div class="mm-sg-req">
                                    <span class="mm-sg-req__num">02</span>
                                    <h3>Copied as rich HTML</h3>
                                    <p>Use “Copy signature”, not plain text copy.</p>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                            <div class="col-lg-4 col-md-6 mb-25 tp_fade_anim" data-delay=".7">
                                <div class="mm-sg-req">
                                    <span class="mm-sg-req__num">03</span>
                                    <h3>Outlook is closed once</h3>
                                    <p>Restart Outlook after saving so the signature loads.</p>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <!-- before you start end -->

                <!-- steps start -->
                <!-- mm: ADIMLAR. Iskelet service-details'in process bileseni.
                     Gorsel kutulari YER TUTUCU — `data-shot` beklenen dosya
                     adini soyluyor, gercek ekran goruntuleri gelince
                     <figure> icerigi <img> ile degistirilecek. -->
                <div class="mm-sg-steps p-relative z-index-2" data-bg-color="#04122b">
                    <div class="container container-1430">
                        <div class="mm-template-showcase__intro mm-sg-steps__head">
                            <div>
                                <span class="mm-section-kicker tp-split-text tp-split-right">Step by step</span>
                                <h2 class="mm-template-showcase__title tp-split-text tp-split-right">Five steps.<br><em>Once per person.</em></h2>
                            </div>
                            <div class="mm-template-showcase__intro-copy tp_fade_anim" data-delay=".4">
                                <p>Nothing is installed and nothing runs in the background. You copy a signature and paste it where Outlook Classic keeps it.</p>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="mm-sg-step">
                            <div class="row align-items-center">
                                <div class="col-xl-5 col-lg-6">
                                    <div class="mm-sg-step__copy">
                                        <span class="mm-sg-step__num">Step 01</span>
                                        <h3>Copy the signature</h3>
                                        <p>In Mailmyra, open the signature in the builder (<b>Signatures → Edit in builder</b>) and press <b>Copy signature</b>. The clipboard now holds the formatted signature, not the code.</p>
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                                <div class="col-xl-7 col-lg-6">
                                    <figure class="mm-sg-shot" data-shot="outlook-classic-step-01.png">
                                        <span class="mm-sg-shot__label">Screenshot</span>
                                        <span class="mm-sg-shot__file">outlook-classic-step-01.png</span>
                                    </figure>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="mm-sg-step">
                            <div class="row align-items-center">
                                <div class="col-xl-5 col-lg-6">
                                    <div class="mm-sg-step__copy">
                                        <span class="mm-sg-step__num">Step 02</span>
                                        <h3>Open the signature editor</h3>
                                        <p>In Outlook: <b>File → Options → Mail → Signatures…</b></p>
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                                <div class="col-xl-7 col-lg-6">
                                    <figure class="mm-sg-shot" data-shot="outlook-classic-step-02.png">
                                        <span class="mm-sg-shot__label">Screenshot</span>
                                        <span class="mm-sg-shot__file">outlook-classic-step-02.png</span>
                                    </figure>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="mm-sg-step">
                            <div class="row align-items-center">
                                <div class="col-xl-5 col-lg-6">
                                    <div class="mm-sg-step__copy">
                                        <span class="mm-sg-step__num">Step 03</span>
                                        <h3>Create a new signature</h3>
                                        <p>Click <b>New</b>, give it a name, then paste into the edit box with <b>Ctrl + V</b>.</p>
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                                <div class="col-xl-7 col-lg-6">
                                    <figure class="mm-sg-shot" data-shot="outlook-classic-step-03.png">
                                        <span class="mm-sg-shot__label">Screenshot</span>
                                        <span class="mm-sg-shot__file">outlook-classic-step-03.png</span>
                                    </figure>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="mm-sg-step">
                            <div class="row align-items-center">
                                <div class="col-xl-5 col-lg-6">
                                    <div class="mm-sg-step__copy">
                                        <span class="mm-sg-step__num">Step 04</span>
                                        <h3>Set the defaults</h3>
                                        <p>Pick the signature for <b>New messages</b> and for <b>Replies/forwards</b>, then press OK.</p>
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                                <div class="col-xl-7 col-lg-6">
                                    <figure class="mm-sg-shot" data-shot="outlook-classic-step-04.png">
                                        <span class="mm-sg-shot__label">Screenshot</span>
                                        <span class="mm-sg-shot__file">outlook-classic-step-04.png</span>
                                    </figure>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="mm-sg-step">
                            <div class="row align-items-center">
                                <div class="col-xl-5 col-lg-6">
                                    <div class="mm-sg-step__copy">
                                        <span class="mm-sg-step__num">Step 05</span>
                                        <h3>Send yourself a test</h3>
                                        <p>Compose a new message and check the signature before sending it anywhere else.</p>
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                                <div class="col-xl-7 col-lg-6">
                                    <figure class="mm-sg-shot" data-shot="outlook-classic-step-05.png">
                                        <span class="mm-sg-shot__label">Screenshot</span>
                                        <span class="mm-sg-shot__file">outlook-classic-step-05.png</span>
                                    </figure>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <!-- steps end -->

                <!-- verify start -->
                <div class="mm-sg-verify p-relative z-index-2">
                    <div class="container container-1430">
                        <div class="row align-items-start">
                            <div class="col-lg-5">
                                <div class="mm-sg-verify__copy">
                                    <span class="mm-section-kicker">DID IT WORK?</span>
                                    <h2 class="mm-sg-title">What it should<br><em>look like.</em></h2>
                                    <p>Images sit at their intended size, the layout does not break into a single column, and links stay clickable.</p>
                                    <figure class="mm-sg-shot mm-sg-shot--wide" data-shot="outlook-classic-result.png">
                                        <span class="mm-sg-shot__label">Screenshot</span>
                                        <span class="mm-sg-shot__file">outlook-classic-result.png</span>
                                    </figure>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                            <div class="col-lg-7">
                                <ul class="mm-sg-trouble">
                                <li>
                                    <b>Logo shows as a red X</b>
                                    <span>The image URL is not reachable. Export again so images point at cdn.mailmyra.com.</span>
                                </li>
                                <li>
                                    <b>Extra table borders appear</b>
                                    <span>A known Outlook 2512 bug. Re-copy from Mailmyra — our output sets border:none explicitly.</span>
                                </li>
                                <li>
                                    <b>Everything is left aligned in one column</b>
                                    <span>The signature was pasted as plain text. Copy again with Copy signature.</span>
                                </li>
                                </ul>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <!-- verify end -->

                <!-- quirks start -->
                <div class="mm-sg-quirks p-relative z-index-2" data-bg-color="#04122b">
                    <div class="container container-1430">
                        <div class="row justify-content-center">
                            <div class="col-xl-9">
                                <div class="mm-sg-head text-center">
                                    <span class="mm-section-kicker">CLIENT BEHAVIOUR</span>
                                    <h2 class="mm-sg-title">Why this client is the hard one</h2>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="row">
                                <div class="col-lg-6">
                                    <div class="mm-sg-quirk">
                                        <span class="mm-sg-quirk__icon"><i class="fa-light fa-code" aria-hidden="true"></i></span>
                                        <h3>The engine</h3>
                                        <p>Desktop Outlook renders HTML with Microsoft Word, not a browser. Flexbox, grid, float and modern CSS simply do not exist there.</p>
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                                <div class="col-lg-6">
                                    <div class="mm-sg-quirk">
                                        <span class="mm-sg-quirk__icon"><i class="fa-light fa-shield-check" aria-hidden="true"></i></span>
                                        <h3>What we do</h3>
                                        <p>Every signature is built as nested tables with fully inline styles, so nothing depends on a stylesheet that will never arrive.</p>
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                        </div>
