                                <div class="mm-sg-head">
                                    <span class="mm-section-kicker">QUESTIONS</span>
                                    <h2 class="mm-sg-title">Asked about<br><em>Outlook Classic.</em></h2>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                            <div class="col-lg-8">
                                <div class="mm-sg-faq__list">
                                <div class="mm-sg-faq__item">
                                    <h3>Do I need an add-in?</h3>
                                    <p>No. Nothing is installed. You paste a signature into the client you already use.</p>
                                </div>
                                <div class="mm-sg-faq__item">
                                    <h3>Can I use the .htm file instead?</h3>
                                    <p>Yes. Download the .htm file and drop it into the Outlook Signatures folder, then restart Outlook.</p>
                                </div>
                                <div class="mm-sg-faq__item">
                                    <h3>Will my colleagues need to repeat this?</h3>
                                    <p>Each person adds the signature once on their own machine, or you distribute the .htm file to the team.</p>
                                </div>
                                </div>
